
# 2025-11-20 21:08:41.867302
+Code the following app
+```
+Build a Base Mini App: "MoodPal" – Mood to Chibi Generator
+
+Single screen, mobile-first:
+- Text input: placeholder "How do you feel? (e.g., floating and in love)"
+- Big button: "Summon MoodPal" (purple gradient)
+- On click: Parse mood keywords (love=heart eyes/pink neon; chaos=swirl eyes/yellow sparks; melancholy=star eyes/blue aura) → draw unique chibi on canvas (big expressive eyes, round head, tiny body, transparent BG, soft neon colors shifting by mood)
+- Add eye-blink animation (CSS keyframes)
+- Below: "Download PNG" button (transparent export)
+
+Use HTML/JS/CSS + canvas only. Make 100+ unique variants via keyword/random tweaks. No wallet/mint.
+
+Output: Full deployable HTML code + live preview.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

