+
+Must include:
+• Full cute chibi character (big expressive eyes, round head, tiny body, hair, accessories)
+• Mood-based style & colors (examples: love → heart eyes + pink neon, chaos → swirl eyes + yellow sparks, sad → teary eyes + blue aura, angry → fire eyes + red, etc.)
+• Automatic eye-blink animation every 3–4 seconds
+• 100 % transparent background
+• Works with ANY language (English, French, Spanish, Japanese, emojis…)
